    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-Time Combat System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in thrilling PvE and high-stakes full loot PvP combat.<br></li><li>Execute tactical maneuvers with abilities like block, parry, and dash.<br></li><li>Master the fine art of war and make every second count in visceral real-time battles.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player-Driven Economy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The economy of the game is dictated by the players.<br></li><li>Gather a wide range of resources from the world around you.<br></li><li>Use your crafting skills to create powerful gear.<br></li><li>Trade crafted items in the market to profit or bolster your arsenal.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Massive Server</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The entire game world exists on one enormous server.<br></li><li>Experience seamless interaction with players from around the globe.<br></li><li>Form alliances and establish your dominion, or wander as a lone wolf.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Open World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a vast, perilous world teeming with danger and opportunity.<br></li><li>Every corner of the map holds potential resources or threats.<br></li><li>Your actions can have far-reaching consequences, affecting the balance of power and the state of the economy.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-Time Combat System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in thrilling PvE and high-stakes full loot PvP combat.<br></li><li>Execute tactical maneuvers with abilities like block, parry, and dash.<br></li><li>Master the fine art of war and make every second count in visceral real-time battles.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player-Driven Economy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The economy of the game is dictated by the players.<br></li><li>Gather a wide range of resources from the world around you.<br></li><li>Use your crafting skills to create powerful gear.<br></li><li>Trade crafted items in the market to profit or bolster your arsenal.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Massive Server</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The entire game world exists on one enormous server.<br></li><li>Experience seamless interaction with players from around the globe.<br></li><li>Form alliances and establish your dominion, or wander as a lone wolf.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Open World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a vast, perilous world teeming with danger and opportunity.<br></li><li>Every corner of the map holds potential resources or threats.<br></li><li>Your actions can have far-reaching consequences, affecting the balance of power and the state of the economy.</li></ul>",
